; Sim-to-deploy regression for the JAX batch twin (#361): the policy was trained entirely in
; jit-compiled JAX (scripts/train_chase_jax.py over chase_twin_jax.batched_step — ~100k env-steps/s
; on CPU, no Godot, no socket), exported flax->torch->ncnn, and must still catch targets in the
; REAL Godot chase engine. Reuses the standard trained-chase behavioral checker.

